flowchart TD
  A([New user]) --> B[Sign up]
  B --> C{Data valid?}
  C -- password under 8 --> E1[/Hint under the field/] --> B
  C -- email taken --> E2[/Error: email taken, screen 2/] --> L[Sign in]
  C -- yes --> P[Your projects]
  L --> LC{Email and password right?}
  LC -- no --> E3[/Error: wrong email or password, screen 1/] --> L
  LC -- yes --> P
  P --> Q{How to start?}
  Q -- empty project --> R[Project created]
  Q -- from GitHub --> S[Repository link]
  S --> T{Link valid?}
  T -- not GitHub --> E4[/Error with an example link, screen 7/] --> S
  T -- private or missing --> E5[/Error: not found/] --> S
  T -- GitHub not answering --> E6[/Error: try again/] --> S
  T -- yes --> R
  R --> U[Invite: role and link] --> V([Link sent])
